From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 20:12:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Support `monty -` to read the program from standard input

Like `python -`, a `-` file argument now reads the whole program from
stdin and runs it as a script (or with `-i`, before the REPL), reporting
errors against `<stdin>`. Other CLI options still apply.

Closes #1101
